00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.000
Rosmarin,

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:58.600
Thymian,

00:01:58.600 --> 00:01:59.300
Lorbeerblätter

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.200
und etwas Butter.

